-- THE SITE'S OWN POSTING DATE — every other site, after the per-site probe of 2026-11-09.
--
-- Owner 2026-11-09: «we need it solved». Migration 20261109233000 did wasalt. This one records what the
-- per-site probe found on the remaining undated sites (each read LIVE: 2–3 real ad pages / API answers per
-- site, compared with our row and its first sighting), and fills the stored rows that already hold the date.
--
-- 1. ops_source_posting_date_capture: the sites whose stored rows ALREADY carry the site's posting date in
--    their own capture (checked 2026-11-09 on production: every active row readable, none later than first
--    seen + 1 day). public.ops_backfill_source_posting_date() then fills date_added from it — same proof,
--    same never-write rules. 'utc' = the site's zone-less stamp is UTC (hazim: equals the record's ObjectId
--    time; daryusuf / aalbarrak / almuteb / masar: WordPress date_gmt).
--    Not here, on purpose: aqargate (a per-row zone rule), raghdan (the stored field holds a LICENCE day on
--    213 of 385 rows) and the sites that publish a non-ISO form (albdah, almotmkenah, ego, moftah) — their
--    scrapers convert it, so the next crawl fills them.
-- 2. ops_source_posting_date_policy: 'yes' for every site whose scraper now writes the date (the read field
--    and the live ad behind it in `evidence`), so mon_detect_source_posting_date_fill_regressed() watches its
--    NEW rows; 'no' with the page read in proof_url; 'unknown' when the site could not be read.
--    Baselines are EXPECTED until new rows exist; the three RSS-only sites (bossbih, aljassim, shomou) are
--    partial by the feed's size (it lists the 10 most recently changed ads), raghdan by its two ad kinds.
--
-- Never our first-seen / scrape time, a licence date, an edit / bump / «آخر تحديث» date, a sitemap lastmod,
-- relative text alone, or a guessed year (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §20).

on conflict (tbl, col, path) do nothing;

on conflict (platform) do update set
  publishes = excluded.publishes, read_from = excluded.read_from, baseline_fill_pct = excluded.baseline_fill_pct,
  baseline_basis = excluded.baseline_basis, measured_on = excluded.measured_on, evidence = excluded.evidence,
  proof_url = excluded.proof_url;

-- Named so the repair guard sees what watches the fill; returns 0 inside its 20 h gate.
select public.mon_detect_source_posting_date_fill_regressed();
